---
source: src/tui/render/first_start.rs
expression: "drawn(&no_copies, 60, 15)"
---
" asqr                                                       "
" ╭ First start ───────────────────────────────────────────╮ "
" │       Compact copies: images are kept as WebP copies,  │ "
" │       about a fifth of their size; every other file is │ "
" │       kept as it is.                                   │ "
" │   ( ) exact copies                                     │ "
" │       Exact copies: every file is kept byte for byte,  │ "
" │       images included.                                 │ "
" │ ❯ ( ) no copies                                        │ "
" │       No copies: no file is kept. asqr still records   │ "
" │       each file's size and checksum, so a replay can   │ "
" │       tell the file is gone.                           │ "
" ╰─────── writes …/Application Support/asqr/settings.toml ╯ "
"                                                            "
" ↑/↓  move   enter  pick   q  quit               asqr 0.0.0 "
